## The node name carries the harbour, so two ports on one box do not collide
## and an operator attaching to one knows which quay he is standing on.
-sname tom_harbour_${TOM_HARBOUR}

-setcookie ${ERLANG_COOKIE}

+K true
+A 8

## The port serialises every trade at this harbour through one process, so an
## unhandled exit in a desk is a fault worth seeing rather than a blip.
-kernel shell_history enabled
